-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(235,66,3,0.35)]\r\n\n                       active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\"><span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-1.5\">Upload Image<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full bg-gradient-to-r\r\n\n                         from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent\r\n\n                         transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-full\"></span></a></div><button aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300 md:hidden\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\"><div class=\"relative h-4 w-5\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;top:2px;transform:none\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[7px] h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;opacity:1;transform:none\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;top:12px;transform:none\"></span></div></button></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 top-0 -z-10 md:hidden transition-opacity duration-300\n          pointer-events-none opacity-0\" style=\"background:rgba(255, 241, 239, 0.96);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"mt-20 flex flex-col gap-2 px-6 transition-all duration-500\n            -translate-y-4 opacity-0\"><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white\r\n\n                       transition-transform duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\">Upload Image →</a><p class=\"mt-6 px-4 text-center text-xs\" style=\"color:#8a7a77\">Free · No signup · No uploads</p></div></div></header><main style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:120px 20px 80px;min-height:100vh\"><h1 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-bottom:20px\">Privacy Policy</h1><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 24, 2026</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Image processing</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">The selected image is processed in your browser using WebAssembly; the application does not send it to BgRemove&#x27;s server for background removal. Your browser does make requests to load the site and the model files the tool needs. The image is held in browser memory while you use the tool; you can reset the editor or close the page when done.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Network requests</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">Loading this website and its image-processing model requires your browser to request files from the site&#x27;s host. This is separate from processing the selected image. Refer to your browser and hosting provider&#x27;s privacy information for details about ordinary network requests.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Contact</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">Questions about image handling? Review the<!-- --> <a href=\"/about\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">About page</a>.</p></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235, 66, 3, 0.18);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,241,239,0) 0%, rgba(235,66,3,0.04) 100%)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"blob pointer-events-none absolute -left-20 top-10 h-56 w-56 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #EB4203, transparent 70%)\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"blob pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 bottom-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full opacity-15 blur-3xl\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #0a0a0a, transparent 70%);animation-delay:3s\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6 py-14 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 select-none\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-lg text-white\r\n\n                           transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                           group-hover:rotate-[-8deg] group-hover:scale-110\r\n\n                           group-hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(235,66,3,0.5)]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135de